{
  "_readme": [
    "Each scenario starts from a page state and sends one or more user messages.",
    "Dates are resolved against the frozen 'today' in evals/run.py (2026-11-24).",
    "expect: checks on the state after the turn. A plain value means equal; null means empty.",
    "  Matchers: {contains: x}, {excludes: x} for lists (case-insensitive substring),",
    "  {min: x}, {max: x} for numbers and ISO dates. 'moods.party' addresses one mood.",
    "expect_any: a list of 'expect' blocks when more than one answer is right (the closest one is scored).",
    "allow: fields the model may change freely (otherwise any other change counts as a mistake).",
    "results: 'some' or 'none' after the turn. tools: must / must_not / max_calls (default 4).",
    "reply_excludes: text that must never appear in the reply.",
    "faq: {ids: [...]} the FAQ tool must return one of these FAQs in that turn; {none: true} no FAQ answers it and the reply must say so."
  ],
  "scenarios": [
